Fall back to dlsym for core GL entry points when eglGetProcAddress returns null.

EGL < 1.5 (e.g. Imagination PowerVR, which reports EGL 1.4) is not required to
return core client-API functions from eglGetProcAddress, so Skia/femtovg GL init
fails and Slint drops to software rendering. Resolve them from libGLESv2 instead,
as SDL/GLFW/libepoxy/Qt do.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Tasuku Suzuki <tasuku.suzuki@signal-slot.co.jp>
